    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61170" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυψέλη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>any hollow vessel: chest, box</i>
			(whence Cypselus was called), <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.92
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.164a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				5.17.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑξμέδιμνος κ.</span>, of <i>a
				cornchest</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				631
			</span></i>; <i>bee-hive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.601c
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυψέλαι φρονημάτων</span>
			<i>boxes</i> full of thoughts, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				703
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hollow of the ear</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.85
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυψελίς</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i>ear-wax</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυψέλην . .
				ἔχεις . . ἐν τοῖς ὠσίν</span>, prov. of stupid men, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				620
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				213
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				2.63
			</span></i>.</div>
